    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Bài 8",
     "texto": [
      "Topic: physical appearance, the body, household chores, health and hygiene.",
      "In this part: **how to describe someone and parts of the body**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Watch out for some words",
     "texto": [
      "**xinh đẹp** is said of women and **đẹp trai** of men.",
      "**ốm** in the south means «thin», but in the north it means «sick». For «thin» in the north you say **gầy**.",
      "Vietnamese people comment on looks very openly («you've got so fat!»): it's usually not rude."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Tip: tay and chân",
     "texto": [
      "**tay** is the whole arm and hand; **chân**, the whole leg and foot.",
      "To be specific: **bàn tay** (hand), **bàn chân** (foot), **ngón tay** (finger), **ngón chân** (toe), **móng tay** (nail)…"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
